      <input x="600" y="704" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(1) The general 24 V rail is 2.5 mm2. The S200 24 V feed is 1.0 mm2." />
      <input x="600" y="718" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="There is no 48 V rail." />
      <input x="600" y="732" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(2) G2 is an open 24 V slot. SDR-480-24 is the slot size, not a" />
