      <input x="600" y="760" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(3) Both 0 V rails meet at X1 pin 4. W1 is the only bond to PE." />
      <input x="600" y="774" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="Confirm W1 in the S200 PTI manual." />
      <input x="600" y="788" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(4) F14 is 6 A on the S200 rail. F24 is 20 A on the general rail." />
