      <input x="600" y="704" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(1) Two NC channels go to the PNOZ s4, article 750104. The third NC" />
      <input x="600" y="718" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="is DIO input index 2 only." />
      <input x="600" y="732" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(2) Do not feed cabinet 24 V into S11 or S21. The PNOZ makes the" />
      <input x="600" y="746" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="test pulses." />
      <input x="600" y="760" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(3) The reset sits between S12 and S34. Set a monitored reset. The" />
      <input x="600" y="774" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="detent text is TBC." />
      <input x="600" y="788" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(4) OPEN: the E-stop contact block and the reset button are not" />
    </inputs>
