      <input x="600" y="768" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(1) Order 6SL5510-1BB11-0AA0. This is the PTI standard drive, not" />
      <input x="600" y="782" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="the PROFINET code." />
      <input x="600" y="796" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(2) L2 is open. Mains uses L1 and L3. DCP, R1 and R2 stay open." />
      <input x="600" y="810" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(3) Power cable is 4G1.5 mm2 shielded. Brake pair is 2x0.75 mm2. The" />
      <input x="600" y="824" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="coil stays on X108." />
      <input x="600" y="838" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(4) The Siemens motor-cable order code is TODO." />
