      <input x="600" y="896" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(1) The drive STO screw is one terminal. DI3 is the second channel." />
      <input x="600" y="910" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="The SoMove parameter is TODO." />
      <input x="600" y="924" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(2) Do not tie P24 to the cabinet 24 V. There is no braking" />
      <input x="600" y="938" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="resistor." />
      <input x="600" y="952" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(3) R1C is the fault-relay common. R1B is the NC contact. R1A is" />
      <input x="600" y="966" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="open." />
      <input x="600" y="980" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(4) RJ45 pin numbers are TBC. See the Modbus manual NVE41308." />
