      <input x="600" y="768" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(1) Each coil is in series with the NC contact of the other relay." />
      <input x="600" y="782" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(2) The off state puts both motor leads on 0 V. Do not command both" />
      <input x="600" y="796" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="directions." />
      <input x="600" y="810" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(3) Confirm that Finder 62.32 .4000 has no internal diode. D2 and D3" />
      <input x="600" y="824" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="stay fitted." />
      <input x="600" y="838" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(4) The actuator current is not on a nameplate. The power section is" />
      <input x="600" y="852" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="TBC. Pin 14 is open." />
