      <input x="40" y="208" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="TBC: 440_S200FB is STO_EP and is not landed on a connector." />
      <input x="40" y="236" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="TBC: ATV320 RJ45 pin numbers, manual NVE41308. DI3 SoMove parameter is TODO." />
      <input x="40" y="264" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="TBC: RevPi X4 order and the RS-485 printed order." />
      <input x="40" y="292" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="TBC: W1 is the only 0 V to PE bond. Remove it if the S200 PTI manual forbids it." />
      <input x="40" y="320" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="The Instagrid source is 15.7 A continuous. The drive rated input is 17.8 A at 200 V." />
      <input x="40" y="348" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="The drive does not run at rated input on this source." />
